Employees from LAVS Trading, students from Cortijo de Palsabangon Farm OPC, and volunteers from neighboring barangays came together for a community tree-planting day marking the start of the wet season.

Native seedlings were planted along a reforestation corridor near the farm, part of an ongoing commitment to pair commercial growth with environmental stewardship.
